{"title":"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a70ef3ff6592247a7bb65ba8bb54d724b112890.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A, B, C, D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" /> are four \"consecutive\" points on the circumference of a circle and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/f/c9ffd7d6a650eb62b9db7f0f6cb69e25206a27dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P, Q, R, S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"16\" /> are points on the circumference which are respectively the midpoints of the arcs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/0/cf08876ffee2db3a548f101218b6f540fd4dc49c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB, BC, CD, DA.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"143\" height=\"16\" /> Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/6/ec6916b50feec24773d374eaada26a95bcabc6fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PR$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> is perpendicular to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/a/5da1bd2309dd6ebab80a9ada0c1cd7568ff5a30e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"26\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70e6f4cabae24da71f62624ad540f46d6855d6de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T=PR\\cap QS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"114\" height=\"18\" />. Then,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/c/dac21bfcaa3a3010609e49cbd2e4ff4116ae55cb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle PTQ=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\widehat{PB}+\\widehat{BQ}+\\widehat{RD}+\\widehat{DS}\\right)=\\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\widehat{AB}+\\widehat{BC}+\\widehat{CD}+\\widehat{DA}\\right)=\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot360^\\circ=90^\\circ\\]\" width=\"667\" height=\"37\" />\nso we are done.\n</p><p>~ <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Eevee9406\">eevee9406</a>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO\">1975 Canadian MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017171959\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.019 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 65/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 915/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 52/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1392/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.013      1 Template:Old_CanadaMO_box_(6-8_Problems)/8\n100.00%    7.013      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15105:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017171959 and revision id 282718. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}